                    {
                        "form_id": "dc0c22f6-2d6a-4f33-aafd-c0f6488e9595",
                        "entry_id": "221b5329-b086-3b5b-9029-df39fa6ffb41",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "downfaced"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3c82d0e-1cc3-3775-b6e8-143a0b30a941",
                        "entry_id": "221b5329-b086-3b5b-9029-df39fa6ffb41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To persist in an assertion in the face of opposition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "rare",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7e6ba05-8c86-4b6f-bca6-dbda8c627127",
                                "sense_id": "c3c82d0e-1cc3-3775-b6e8-143a0b30a941",
                                "text": "He will not admit anything, and downfaces everybody. If he can't out-argue them he bullies them, and then takes their silence for agreement with his views."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "555e3dfd-9140-4df1-bc03-ccf3daabd7ae",
                                "sense_id": "c3c82d0e-1cc3-3775-b6e8-143a0b30a941",
                                "text": "Didn't I tell you? As true as I'm drinking this porter if he was at his last gasp he'd try to downface you that dying was living."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b7118ae-746f-4a31-a481-608b87a0895b",
                                "sense_id": "c3c82d0e-1cc3-3775-b6e8-143a0b30a941",
                                "text": "Mr Kenmis, this lady at a very great risk to herself has had the courage to downface me in my office and show me that an injustice has been done."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ccdb3a82-5b2a-48e9-8bd4-8e4f1c2ee463",
                                "sense_id": "c3c82d0e-1cc3-3775-b6e8-143a0b30a941",
                                "text": "The fact is that Gladstone exaggerated or minimised the role of fenianism depending on what line of opposing argument he was endeavouring to downface at any particular time."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b48ffc3-d7f0-3923-ad24-79beaad711ce",
                        "entry_id": "221b5329-b086-3b5b-9029-df39fa6ffb41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To disparage; to cause to lose face."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45a97419-d00b-4f78-9df9-fd6fcf47b014",
                                "sense_id": "6b48ffc3-d7f0-3923-ad24-79beaad711ce",
                                "text": "Shucks, I didn't want fer them furriners to downface me and, sartin sure, didn't want my kinspeople to be shamed afore them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "749f3798-e9fd-4b97-961f-fe91422391ee",
                                "sense_id": "6b48ffc3-d7f0-3923-ad24-79beaad711ce",
                                "text": "For a student to downface and humiliate the Premier in a televised debate, to speak to him as a rather high-handed superior might a junior, as Wuerkaixi did to Li Peng on May 19, was very brave, but also unwise and flatly contradictory to Chinese culture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d78fba3-240f-4878-bef5-8d7cf930636d",
                                "sense_id": "6b48ffc3-d7f0-3923-ad24-79beaad711ce",
                                "text": "My feelings had taken over, elation at having been able to downface the silly woman, but anger at her naked, arrogant anti-Semitism."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
